    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="parts-worksheet" class="doc-h2">5b. Printable parts worksheet (manual build)</h2>
            <p class="doc-body">All 29 printed-part codes extracted from the assembly manual
            (192244_HDRY_System__Assembly_Manual.pdf, 1 Feb 2025). Each row maps the code to its
            source 3MF and a preview pulled from that 3MF's own plate renders (no external render
            needed). Work the checklist top-to-bottom: create the <code>printing_3d_models</code>
            row + child <code>inventory_items</code> + BOM line, then push a <code>printing_3d_jobs</code>
            entry to <a href="[% c.uri_for('/3d/queue') %]" class="doc-link">/3d/queue</a>.
            Pictures are served from <code>/static/images/3d/hdry/parts/</code>.</p>
